export const BLEACH_INDONESIAN_VTT = "WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.919\nBLEACH EPISODE 45\n\n2\n00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.676\nGetsuga Tensho menyatu\ndengan Gran Rey Cero.\n\n3\n00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:13.179\nKau yang lahir dari perpaduan segalanya\n\n4\n00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.223\nsangat cocok dengan kekuatan ini.\n\n5\n00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.350\nNamun…\n\n6\n00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:21.396\nKendati demikian, tetap belum cukup.\n\n7\n00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.954\nMELINDUNGIMU\n\n8\n00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.919\nBLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR\n\n9\n00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.590\nBrazo Izquierdo Del Diablo,\n\n10\n00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:14.467\nLa Muerte!\n\n11\n00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.263\nBagus!\n\n12\n00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.932\nLanjutkan terus seperti ini\ndan kalahkan yang lainnya.\n\n13\n00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:33.403\nApa-apaan?\n\n14\n00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.905\n- Hanya kalian berdua?\n- Di mana Ichigo?\n\n15\n00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.366\nDia dan Inoue naik untuk mencari Yhwach.\n\n16\n00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.118\nDasar.\n\n17\n00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:42.745\nSetidaknya, dia tidak menerjang sendirian.\n\n18\n00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.332\n- Renji?\n- Rukia, kau pergi dulu saja.\n\n19\n00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.042\nSerahkan yang di sini kepadaku.\n\n20\n00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:49.919\nAku mengerti.\n\n21\n00:02:57.468 --> 00:02:59.178\nSepertinya kalian\nmasih belum memahami situasinya.\n\n22\n00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:04.058\nKalian semua hanya figuran bagiku.\n\n23\n00:03:12.483 --> 00:03:14.694\nUryu Ishida, apakah kau hanya bisa kabur?\n\n24\n00:03:32.253 --> 00:03:36.633\nAyo, pasanglah anak panahmu,\nQuincy terakhir.\n\n25\n00:03:37.508 --> 00:03:39.385\nAku akan menebas panahmu\n\n26\n00:03:40.428 --> 00:03:43.139\ndan akan kuungkapkan\nsegala sesuatu tentang dirimu.\n\n27\n00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:51.940\nCoba saja\nkalau pedangmu bisa mengenaiku.\n\n28\n00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:09.540\nPusaran kekacauan yang tidak tertandingi.\n\n29\n00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:11.209\nInilah\n\n30\n00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.170\nkekuatan Raja Arwah.\n\n31\n00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.092\nKau tidak bisa menghentikannya.\n\n32\n00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.846\nShiten Koshun!\n\n33\n00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.989\nIchigo, apa arti kekuatan?\n\n34\n00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:43.283\nUntuk apa kekuatan itu ada?\n\n35\n00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:47.036\nKau mungkin akan menjawab\n\"untuk melindungi\", 'kan?\n\n36\n00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:52.292\nNamun, itu adalah kekuatan yang lemah.\n\n37\n00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:59.674\nKekuatan yang benar-benar dahsyat adalah\nmenghancurkan banyak orang\n\n38\n00:04:59.757 --> 00:05:01.884\ndan membuat dunia tunduk kepadanya.\n\n39\n00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.138\nKekuatan untuk mengendalikan\nsegala sesuatu di dunia ini.\n\n40\n00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:08.891\nKarena kau bilang akan mengalahkanku,\n\n41\n00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:13.021\nkekuatan itu seharusnya adalah\nkekuatan seperti itu.\n\n42\n00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:15.732\n\"Melindungi\" hanyalah sebuah kebohongan.\n\n43\n00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.275\nJangan berlagak menjadi pahlawan,\n\n44\n00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:18.901\nIchigo.\n\n45\n00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:20.653\n<i>Melindungi.</i>\n\n46\n00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:25.616\n<i>Padahal aku ingin melindungi Kurosaki.</i>\n\n47\n00:05:27.618 --> 00:05:29.746\n<i>Ini semua karena kekuatanku terlalu lemah.</i>\n\n48\n00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:34.375\n<i>Andai saja kekuatanku lebih besar…</i>\n\n49\n00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.809\nDasar trik murahan.\n\n50\n00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:54.103\nAku menolak.\n\n51\n00:06:01.736 --> 00:06:03.154\nMenolak!\n\n52\n00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:16.209\nInoue!\n\n53\n00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:21.089\nKau masih sempat mengkhawatirkan\norang lain?\n\n54\n00:06:34.268 --> 00:06:37.063\nBaiklah, lanjutkan saja.\n\n55\n00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.733\nLanjutkan sampai kekuatanmu\nterkuras habis.\n\n56\n00:06:46.989 --> 00:06:51.202\nAku me… menolak.\n\n57\n00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.844\nInoue…\n\n58\n00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:11.222\nHe-Hentikan.\n\n59\n00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:17.228\nAku… menolak.\n\n60\n00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.907\n- Sudah cukup, Inoue!\n- Berisik sekali.\n\n61\n00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:31.826\nAku menolak!\n\n62\n00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:43.087\nKau menggunakan\nkekuatan terakhirmu untuk Ichigo?\n\n63\n00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:50.219\nNamun, memangnya kenapa?\n\n64\n00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:54.140\n<i>Andai saja kekuatanku</i>\n\n65\n00:07:57.435 --> 00:08:00.688\n<i>lebih besar…</i>\n\n66\n00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:10.656\nTerima kasih sudah bertahan\nsampai sejauh ini, Inoue.\n\n67\n00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.159\nKuchiki.\n\n68\n00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:15.119\nRukia.\n\n69\n00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:18.873\nIchigo, aku datang untuk menyelamatkanmu.\n\n70\n00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.963\nInoue, kau baik-baik saja?\n\n71\n00:08:26.047 --> 00:08:26.964\nIya.\n\n72\n00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:29.300\nTerima kasih sudah menyelamatkanku.\n\n73\n00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.136\nSelanjutnya serahkan padaku.\n\n74\n00:08:38.893 --> 00:08:41.729\nBeberapa waktu tidak bertemu,\nkau telah banyak berubah.\n\n75\n00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.315\nTerbungkus selimut hitam seperti bacang,\n\n76\n00:08:44.398 --> 00:08:45.983\nbahkan telah tumbuh tanduk.\n\n77\n00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:46.901\nBerisik sekali!\n\n78\n00:08:46.984 --> 00:08:48.903\nAku sendiri juga tidak mau\nterbungkus seperti ini.\n\n79\n00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:50.488\nTerlebih lagi, tanduk ini keren, tahu?\n\n80\n00:08:50.571 --> 00:08:51.489\nOmong-omong, ada apa denganmu?\n\n81\n00:08:51.572 --> 00:08:52.990\nJangan tiba-tiba datang\ndan berbicara omong kosong.\n\n82\n00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:54.075\nApa katamu?\n\n83\n00:08:54.158 --> 00:08:56.244\nInikah caramu berbicara\nkepada orang yang menyelamatkanmu?\n\n84\n00:08:56.327 --> 00:08:57.578\nAku juga tidak memintamu\nuntuk menyelamatkanku.\n\n85\n00:08:57.662 --> 00:08:58.996\nBeraninya orang yang\ndibungkus seperti bacang\n\n86\n00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.414\ndan dihajar\nhabis-habisan berbicara seperti ini.\n\n87\n00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:03.668\nSaat itu, aku baru saja\nmau menyerang balik.\n\n88\n00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:09.465\nKau sepertinya tidak gentar.\n\n89\n00:09:09.966 --> 00:09:11.300\nTentu saja.\n\n90\n00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:13.344\nRukia Kuchiki.\n\n91\n00:09:13.427 --> 00:09:17.265\nShinigami yang membimbing Ichigo, benar?\n\n92\n00:09:18.849 --> 00:09:21.769\nJika aku harus berterima kasih\npada Shinigami,\n\n93\n00:09:21.852 --> 00:09:23.187\nseharusnya orang itu adalah kau.\n\n94\n00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:26.774\nKau yang menarik pelatuk\nuntuk kebangkitannya.\n\n95\n00:09:27.692 --> 00:09:30.778\nKalau begitu, aku tidak perlu\nmeminta maaf atas ketidaksopananku.\n\n96\n00:09:32.154 --> 00:09:35.783\nOrang yang akan mengalahkanmu\njuga adalah aku dan dia.\n\n97\n00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:42.248\n- Rukia, ayo maju.\n- Baik.\n\n98\n00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:45.835\nAda apa?\n\n99\n00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.712\nSungguh tidak kreatif.\n\n100\n00:09:53.634 --> 00:09:54.468\n<i>Satu.</i>\n\n101\n00:09:55.136 --> 00:09:56.554\n<i>Dua.</i>\n\n102\n00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:00.016\n<i>Tiga.</i>\n\n103\n00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:01.225\nAku bisa melihatnya.\n\n104\n00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:06.689\nBisa-bisanya Quincy terakhir\nmenyerang dari belakang dengan pedang.\n\n105\n00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:08.274\nIni panah.\n\n106\n00:10:08.357 --> 00:10:10.651\nCoba ramalkan juga\napa yang akan kukatakan.\n\n107\n00:10:10.735 --> 00:10:12.278\nGrand Master!\n\n108\n00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:16.282\nPrasyaratnya adalah\nada kesempatan berikutnya.\n\n109\n00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.168\nSungguh penampilan yang memalukan.\n\n110\n00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:31.881\nNamun, itu sangat cocok denganmu,\nUryu Ishida.\n\n111\n00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:54.987\nKekuatan yang menarik.\n\n112\n00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:59.200\nNamun, bertarung bersama teman\nsepertinya justru menjadi belenggu.\n\n113\n00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.619\nRukia, lebih cepat lagi.\n\n114\n00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:03.954\nJatuhkan dia.\n\n115\n00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:06.374\nTidak perlu kau katakan.\n\n116\n00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.753\n<i>Andai saja aku punya kekuatan,</i>\n\n117\n00:11:53.712 --> 00:11:59.635\n<i>Kurosaki dan Kuchiki\ntidak akan terluka separah ini.</i>\n\n118\n00:12:00.761 --> 00:12:02.888\n<i>Ini semua karena kekuatanku terlalu lemah.</i>\n\n119\n00:12:04.014 --> 00:12:08.269\n<i>Karena itu, Kurosaki dan Kuchiki\nmenjadi menderita.</i>\n\n120\n00:12:09.895 --> 00:12:13.899\n<i>Andai saja kekuatanku bisa menjadi</i>\n\n121\n00:12:14.817 --> 00:12:15.901\n<i>lebih besar.</i>\n\n122\n00:12:30.207 --> 00:12:34.837\nKembalilah ke kehampaan,\nwahai orang-orang lemah.\n\n123\n00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:48.350\nSelamat tinggal, Putraku.\n\n124\n00:13:02.072 --> 00:13:04.909\nItu bulan.\n\n125\n00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:06.994\nBan\n\n126\n00:13:11.874 --> 00:13:12.875\nkai.\n\n127\n00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:22.176\nAkhirnya kau menunjukkannya?\n\n128\n00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:25.804\nBankai milikmu.\n\n129\n00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.615\nKurosaki.\n\n130\n00:13:44.698 --> 00:13:45.533\nTernyata begitu.\n\n131\n00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.661\nJadi, itu adalah Zangetsu-mu.\n\n132\n00:13:56.085 --> 00:13:58.921\nAku akan membuat semua kekuatan\n\n133\n00:13:59.755 --> 00:14:02.174\nyang kau miliki tunduk padaku.\n\n134\n00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.853\nKekuatan ini\n\n135\n00:14:15.896 --> 00:14:19.275\nadalah kekuatan yang dibutuhkan\n\n136\n00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:22.027\nuntuk melindungi semua orang darimu.\n\n137\n00:14:23.737 --> 00:14:25.614\nIchigo, kau terlalu lemah.\n\n138\n00:14:25.698 --> 00:14:28.200\nYhwach, aku akan menyerang.\n\n139\n00:14:34.415 --> 00:14:37.376\n<i>Apa? Serangan tebasannya melambat?</i>\n\n140\n00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:41.046\n<i>Namun, aku hanya perlu menangkisnya.</i>\n\n141\n00:14:44.008 --> 00:14:46.176\nPadahal ada perasaan tertebas,\n\n142\n00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.887\nkenapa kau masih ada di sana?\n\n143\n00:14:54.852 --> 00:14:55.811\nApa?\n\n144\n00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:04.153\nTekanan Spiritual yang mengesalkan.\n\n145\n00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:40.773\nIni adalah kekuatan\nyang melampaui batas Shinigami.\n\n146\n00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:44.360\nNamun,\nsudah kubilang, kau terlalu lemah, Ichigo.\n\n147\n00:15:52.242 --> 00:15:55.829\nKekuatan ini seperti berkata\nbahwa ia tidak butuh teman.\n\n148\n00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:10.469\nGetsuga…\n\n149\n00:16:19.728 --> 00:16:24.066\nTensho!\n\n150\n00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:45.963\nKurosaki.\n\n151\n00:17:04.898 --> 00:17:06.734\n\"Dia sedang meremehkanku.\"\n\n152\n00:17:07.776 --> 00:17:10.154\n\"Aku harus mengalahkannya\ndalam sekejap waktu.\"\n\n153\n00:17:10.237 --> 00:17:12.114\nInilah yang kau pikirkan tadi, 'kan?\n\n154\n00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:16.076\nAku tidak meremehkanmu.\n\n155\n00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.329\nAku harus memahamimu dulu\nagar bisa menelanmu.\n\n156\n00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:21.540\nIchigo, cepat tebas! Sekarang juga!\n\n157\n00:17:21.623 --> 00:17:23.876\nLalu, pada detik itu…\n\n158\n00:17:23.959 --> 00:17:24.835\nGetsuga…\n\n159\n00:17:25.419 --> 00:17:27.755\nSekarang sudah berakhir!\n\n160\n00:17:36.138 --> 00:17:37.056\nKurosaki.\n\n161\n00:17:43.187 --> 00:17:45.189\nKau adalah saksi terakhir.\n\n162\n00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:49.318\nAku akan membuatmu menyaksikan sendiri\ndirimu lenyap dari dunia ini.\n\n163\n00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.694\nTanpa bisa melindungi apa pun,\n\n164\n00:17:50.778 --> 00:17:52.154\ntanpa meninggalkan apa pun,\n\n165\n00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:53.739\ntanpa bisa melakukan apa pun,\n\n166\n00:17:53.822 --> 00:17:55.324\nkau akan dilenyapkan begitu saja.\n\n167\n00:17:56.366 --> 00:18:00.829\nAku akan melindungi Kurosaki.\n\n168\n00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:04.291\nTekadmu yang kuat patut dipuji.\n\n169\n00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:08.962\nNamun, dengan kekuatanmu itu,\njangankan melindungi Ichigo,\n\n170\n00:18:09.046 --> 00:18:12.216\nkau bahkan masih jauh dari layak\nuntuk bertarung bersama di sisinya.\n\n171\n00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:14.343\nAlasan kau bisa berada di sini\n\n172\n00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:17.304\nadalah karena Ichigo belum dewasa\ndan tidak bisa melepaskan kenaifannya.\n\n173\n00:18:17.387 --> 00:18:18.764\nYhwach!\n\n174\n00:18:27.272 --> 00:18:31.151\nDari dulu sampai sekarang,\nwanita itu selalu menjadi kelemahanmu.\n\n175\n00:18:31.777 --> 00:18:35.239\nHal yang menghalangi pertarunganmu\n\n176\n00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:38.242\njustru adalah alasanmu memegang pedang,\n\n177\n00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:40.202\nyaitu hati untuk melindungi.\n\n178\n00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.415\nKau justru akan kalah karena bertarung.\n\n179\n00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:47.501\nIchigo.\n\n180\n00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:13.986\nBankai.\n\n181\n00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:21.201\nHakka no Togame.\n\n182\n00:19:27.749 --> 00:19:28.792\nGetsuga\n\n183\n00:19:28.876 --> 00:19:31.044\nTensho!\n\n184\n00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.663\nKuchiki…\n\n185\n00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:13.212\nInilah kekuatan.\n\n186\n00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:16.673\nKau terlalu bodoh.\n\n187\n00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:20.344\nIchigo.\n\n188\n00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:26.725\nInilah akhir dari kekuatan melindungi\nyang kau katakan.\n\n189\n00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:33.482\nLalu, ini juga bukti dari kekuatan dahsyat\nyang kukatakan.\n\n190\n00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.777\n<i>Andai saja kekuatanku</i>\n\n191\n00:20:37.903 --> 00:20:43.742\n<i>bisa menjadi lebih besar.</i>\n\n192\n00:20:49.957 --> 00:20:53.335\nHancurlah menjadi abu, Uryu Ishida.\n\n193\n00:20:56.505 --> 00:20:58.924\nSesuai dugaanku, Uryu Ishida.\n\n194\n00:20:59.007 --> 00:21:00.300\nSenjata andalanmu,\n\n195\n00:21:01.468 --> 00:21:03.303\nLeiden Hant.\n\n196\n00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:06.473\nAyo, langkah selanjutnya\njuga sudah kutebak.\n\n197\n00:21:07.224 --> 00:21:10.269\nKau sebaiknya jangan asal\n\n198\n00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:13.313\nmenggunakan kekuatan Yang Mulia Yhwach\ntanpa pertimbangan.\n\n199\n00:21:14.189 --> 00:21:15.524\nItu akan memunculkan celah.\n\n200\n00:21:15.607 --> 00:21:16.984\nCelah?\n\n201\n00:21:17.734 --> 00:21:22.322\nApakah kau berkata begitu\nkarena sudah berada di belakangku?\n\n202\n00:21:26.368 --> 00:21:27.786\nShuno.\n\n203\n00:21:33.333 --> 00:21:34.584\nTsubaki.\n\n204\n00:21:37.087 --> 00:21:38.255\nAyame.\n\n205\n00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:40.382\nHinagiku.\n\n206\n00:21:43.927 --> 00:21:44.970\nBaigon.\n\n207\n00:21:45.595 --> 00:21:46.722\nLily.\n\n208\n00:22:05.282 --> 00:22:07.701\n<i>Kenapa aku begitu lemah?</i>\n\n209\n00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:13.582\n<i>Kenapa kekuatanku begitu kecil?</i>\n\n210\n00:22:18.837 --> 00:22:20.172\nSternenstaub!\n\n211\n00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:22.341\nAku bisa melihatnya.\n\n212\n00:22:26.344 --> 00:22:28.221\n- Berengsek.\n- Tiga detik.\n\n213\n00:22:28.305 --> 00:22:31.099\nKalau aku terlihat\nseperti berlarian ke sana kemari,\n\n214\n00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:33.268\nitulah penyebab kekalahanmu.\n\n215\n00:22:33.351 --> 00:22:35.520\nBegitu kau menggunakan sekali\npenglihatan masa depan,\n\n216\n00:22:35.604 --> 00:22:37.689\nkau tidak bisa menggunakan\nkekuatan itu lagi selama tiga detik.\n\n217\n00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:41.276\nTiga detik saja tidak mungkin bisa\nmemberimu peluang untuk menang.\n\n218\n00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:45.906\nNamun, aku tetap mendapat tiga detik.\n\n219\n00:22:53.371 --> 00:22:56.124\n<i>Andai saja kekuatanku</i>\n\n220\n00:22:57.292 --> 00:23:00.504\n<i>lebih besar dari saat ini.</i>\n\n221\n00:23:02.631 --> 00:23:05.008\n<i>Begitu besar sampai diriku sendiri\ntidak sanggup menahannya.</i>\n\n222\n00:23:05.967 --> 00:23:08.220\n<i>Andai saja bisa besar\nhingga tidak terbatas…</i>\n\n223\n00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.436\n<i>Padahal, selama menyelimuti seluruh dunia,</i>\n\n224\n00:23:16.937 --> 00:23:23.819\n<i>maka bisa menghilangkan\npertarungan, luka, dan penderitaan,</i>\n\n225\n00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:26.696\n<i>serta segala sesuatu.</i>\n\n226\n00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:43.839\n<i>Jadi, aku…</i>\n\n227\n00:23:44.548 --> 00:23:48.593\nApakah kau akan\nmembuang nyawamu, Orihime Inoue?\n\n228\n00:23:58.186 --> 00:23:59.354\nDengan benda ini…\n\n229\n00:23:59.437 --> 00:24:03.150\nDengan benda ini,\naku bisa melenyapkan kekuatanmu.\n\n230\n00:24:14.244 --> 00:24:15.245\nTunggu.\n\n231\n00:24:17.455 --> 00:24:18.415\nInoue!\n\n232\n00:24:18.999 --> 00:24:21.293\nInoue…\n\n233\n00:25:08.465 --> 00:25:10.508\nBLEACH EPISODE 45\n\n234\n00:25:10.592 --> 00:25:12.802\n<i>Kurosaki, sampai jumpa.</i>\n\n235\n00:25:13.303 --> 00:25:16.431\n<i>Aku akan mengadang semuanya untukmu.</i>\n\n236\n00:25:16.514 --> 00:25:17.766\nMELINDUNGIMU\n\n237\n00:25:17.849 --> 00:25:20.894\nMELINDUNGIMU DENGAN NYAWAKU\n\n";

export const BLEACH_ENGLISH_VTT = "WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.919\nBLEACH EPISODE 45\n\n2\n00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.676\nGetsuga Tensho fused with Gran Rey Cero.\n\n3\n00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:13.179\nBorn from the fusion of all things,\n\n4\n00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.223\nyou are well-suited to this power.\n\n5\n00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.350\nBut...\n\n6\n00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:21.396\nAnd yet... It still falls short!\n\n7\n00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.954\nDEFEND YOU\n\n8\n00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.919\nBLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR\n\n9\n00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.590\nBrazo Izquierdo Del Diablo.\n\n10\n00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:14.467\nLa Muerte!\n\n11\n00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.263\nGreat!\n\n12\n00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.932\nKeep this up and defeat the rest of them!\n\n13\n00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:33.403\nWhat the heck?\n\n14\n00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.905\n- It's just you two?\n- Where's Ichigo?\n\n15\n00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.366\nHe and Inoue went after Yhwach.\n\n16\n00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.118\nGeez.\n\n17\n00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:42.745\nAt least he didn't just charge off alone.\n\n18\n00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.332\n- Renji...\n- Rukia, you go on ahead.\n\n19\n00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.042\nI'll handle things here.\n\n20\n00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:49.919\nAlright.\n\n21\n00:02:57.468 --> 00:02:59.178\nYou don't seem to get it yet.\n\n22\n00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:04.058\nAll of you are just stepping stones to me.\n\n23\n00:03:12.483 --> 00:03:14.694\nUryu Ishida, is running away\nall you can do?\n\n24\n00:03:32.253 --> 00:03:36.633\nCome on, nock your arrows,\nthe last Quincy.\n\n25\n00:03:37.508 --> 00:03:39.385\nI will cut down your arrows\n\n26\n00:03:40.428 --> 00:03:43.139\nand expose everything about you.\n\n27\n00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:51.940\nBring it on, if your sword can reach me.\n\n28\n00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:09.540\nAn unparalleled vortex of chaos.\n\n29\n00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:11.209\nThis is\n\n30\n00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.170\nthe power of the Soul King.\n\n31\n00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.092\nYou can't stop it.\n\n32\n00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.846\nShitenkoshun!\n\n33\n00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.989\nIchigo, what is power?\n\n34\n00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:43.283\nWhat does it exist for?\n\n35\n00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:47.036\nYou'd probably say, \"to defend,\" right?\n\n36\n00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:52.292\nBut that is a weak power.\n\n37\n00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:59.674\nTrue power is the one\nthat crushes everyone,\n\n38\n00:04:59.757 --> 00:05:01.884\nmakes the world bow down,\n\n39\n00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.138\nand takes everything\nin this world in hand.\n\n40\n00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:08.891\nSince you say you'll defeat me,\n\n41\n00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:13.021\nyour power should be like this.\n\n42\n00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:15.732\n\"To defend\" is nothing but a lie.\n\n43\n00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.275\nStop playing the hero,\n\n44\n00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:18.901\nIchigo.\n\n45\n00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:20.653\n<i>To defend...</i>\n\n46\n00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:25.616\n<i>I was trying to defend Kurosaki.</i>\n\n47\n00:05:27.618 --> 00:05:29.746\n<i>But my power is simply too weak.</i>\n\n48\n00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:34.375\n<i>If only my power were stronger...</i>\n\n49\n00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.809\nA mere trifle.\n\n50\n00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:54.103\nI reject!\n\n51\n00:06:01.736 --> 00:06:03.154\nReject!\n\n52\n00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:16.209\nInoue!\n\n53\n00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:21.089\nCan you afford\nto worry about someone else?\n\n54\n00:06:34.268 --> 00:06:37.063\nFine, keep it up.\n\n55\n00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.733\nUntil your power is exhausted.\n\n56\n00:06:46.989 --> 00:06:51.202\nI reject.\n\n57\n00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.844\nInoue...\n\n58\n00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:11.222\nS... stop.\n\n59\n00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:17.228\nI reject.\n\n60\n00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.907\n- Enough, Inoue!\n- Shut up.\n\n61\n00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:31.826\nI reject!\n\n62\n00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:43.087\nDid you exhaust your power on Ichigo?\n\n63\n00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:50.219\nBut so what?\n\n64\n00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:54.140\n<i>If only my power</i>\n\n65\n00:07:57.435 --> 00:08:00.688\n<i>were stronger...</i>\n\n66\n00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:10.656\nYou did well to hold on this long, Inoue.\n\n67\n00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.159\nKuchiki.\n\n68\n00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:15.119\nRukia?\n\n69\n00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:18.873\nIchigo, I'm here to save you.\n\n70\n00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.963\nInoue, are you alright?\n\n71\n00:08:26.047 --> 00:08:26.964\nYeah.\n\n72\n00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:29.300\nThank you for saving me.\n\n73\n00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.136\nLeave the rest to me.\n\n74\n00:08:38.893 --> 00:08:41.729\nIt's been a while,\nand you've changed quite a bit.\n\n75\n00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.315\nWrapped up like a mummy\nin a black blanket,\n\n76\n00:08:44.398 --> 00:08:45.983\nand you've even grown a horn.\n\n77\n00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:46.901\nShut up.\n\n78\n00:08:46.984 --> 00:08:48.903\nI didn't ask to get wrapped up.\n\n79\n00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:50.488\nAnd the horn is cool, okay?\n\n80\n00:08:50.571 --> 00:08:51.489\nAnd what's your deal?\n\n81\n00:08:51.572 --> 00:08:52.990\nDon't just show up and start criticizing.\n\n82\n00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:54.075\nWhat did you say?\n\n83\n00:08:54.158 --> 00:08:56.244\nIs that how you talk to someone\nwho came to save you?\n\n84\n00:08:56.327 --> 00:08:57.578\nI didn't ask you to save me.\n\n85\n00:08:57.662 --> 00:09:00.414\nHow could you even say that after being\nwrapped like a mummy and beaten hard!\n\n86\n00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:03.668\nI was just about to counterattack!\n\n87\n00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:09.465\nLooks like you haven't backed down.\n\n88\n00:09:09.966 --> 00:09:11.300\nOf course not.\n\n89\n00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:13.344\nRukia Kuchiki,\n\n90\n00:09:13.427 --> 00:09:17.265\nthe Soul Reaper who guided Ichigo?\n\n91\n00:09:18.849 --> 00:09:23.187\nIf I had to thank a Soul Reaper,\nit would be you.\n\n92\n00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:26.774\nYou're the one\nwho triggered Ichigo's awakening.\n\n93\n00:09:27.692 --> 00:09:30.778\nThen I don't need to apologize\nfor my rudeness.\n\n94\n00:09:32.154 --> 00:09:35.783\nThe ones who will defeat you\nwill also be me and him.\n\n95\n00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:42.248\n- Rukia, let's go.\n- Okay.\n\n96\n00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:45.835\nWhat's wrong?\n\n97\n00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.712\nNothing new here.\n\n98\n00:09:53.634 --> 00:09:54.468\n<i>One.</i>\n\n99\n00:09:55.136 --> 00:09:56.554\n<i>Two.</i>\n\n100\n00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:00.016\n<i>Three.</i>\n\n101\n00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:01.225\nI see it.\n\n102\n00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:06.689\nThe last Quincy is sneaking up\non someone with a sword.\n\n103\n00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:08.274\nIt's an arrow.\n\n104\n00:10:08.357 --> 00:10:10.651\nTry predicting what I'm about to say too.\n\n105\n00:10:10.735 --> 00:10:12.278\nGrand Master!\n\n106\n00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:16.282\nIf there is a next time.\n\n107\n00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.168\nWhat a pitiful sight.\n\n108\n00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:31.881\nBut it suits you well, Uryu Ishida.\n\n109\n00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:54.987\nA fascinating power.\n\n110\n00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:59.200\nBut fighting alongside your companions\nhas become a shackle instead.\n\n111\n00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.619\nRukia, we need to go faster\n\n112\n00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:03.954\nand defeat that guy.\n\n113\n00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:06.374\nYou don't have to tell me.\n\n114\n00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.753\n<i>If only I had the power,</i>\n\n115\n00:11:53.712 --> 00:11:59.635\n<i>Kurosaki and Kuchiki\nwouldn't have gotten hurt so badly.</i>\n\n116\n00:12:00.761 --> 00:12:02.888\n<i>It's all because my power is too weak.</i>\n\n117\n00:12:04.014 --> 00:12:08.269\n<i>That's why Kurosaki and Kuchiki\nare suffering.</i>\n\n118\n00:12:09.895 --> 00:12:13.899\n<i>If only my power could become</i>\n\n119\n00:12:14.817 --> 00:12:15.901\n<i>stronger.</i>\n\n120\n00:12:30.207 --> 00:12:34.837\nReturn to nothing, you weaklings.\n\n121\n00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:48.350\nFarewell, my son.\n\n122\n00:13:02.072 --> 00:13:04.909\nIt's the moon.\n\n123\n00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:06.994\nBan...\n\n124\n00:13:11.874 --> 00:13:12.875\nkai.\n\n125\n00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:22.176\nSo you're finally showing it?\n\n126\n00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:25.804\nYour Bankai.\n\n127\n00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.615\nKurosaki.\n\n128\n00:13:44.698 --> 00:13:45.533\nI see.\n\n129\n00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.661\nSo that is your Zangetsu.\n\n130\n00:13:56.085 --> 00:13:58.921\nFor all the power you possess,\n\n131\n00:13:59.755 --> 00:14:02.174\nI will make it submit.\n\n132\n00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.853\nThis power\n\n133\n00:14:15.896 --> 00:14:19.275\nis needed to protect everyone\n\n134\n00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:22.027\nfrom you.\n\n135\n00:14:23.737 --> 00:14:25.614\nIchigo, you're too weak.\n\n136\n00:14:25.698 --> 00:14:28.200\nYhwach, here I come.\n\n137\n00:14:34.415 --> 00:14:37.376\n<i>What? My slash got slower?</i>\n\n138\n00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:41.046\n<i>But it's fine. I just need to wield it.</i>\n\n139\n00:14:44.008 --> 00:14:46.176\nI definitely felt like I cut him.\n\n140\n00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.887\nWhy are you still there?\n\n141\n00:14:54.852 --> 00:14:55.811\nWhat?\n\n142\n00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:04.153\nDetestable Spiritual Pressure!\n\n143\n00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:40.773\nSo this is the power\nthat transcends Soul Reapers.\n\n144\n00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:44.360\nBut I told you, you're too weak, Ichigo.\n\n145\n00:15:52.242 --> 00:15:55.829\nIt feels as if the power is saying\nit doesn't need companions.\n\n146\n00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:10.469\nGetsuga\n\n147\n00:16:19.728 --> 00:16:24.066\nTensho!\n\n148\n00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:45.963\nKurosaki.\n\n149\n00:17:04.898 --> 00:17:06.734\n\"He's underestimating me.\"\n\n150\n00:17:07.776 --> 00:17:10.154\n\"I'll defeat him in this instant.\"\n\n151\n00:17:10.237 --> 00:17:12.114\nThat's what you were thinking, right?\n\n152\n00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:16.076\nI'm not underestimating you.\n\n153\n00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.329\nTo consume you,\nI must first know about you.\n\n154\n00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:21.540\nIchigo, slash now! Right now!\n\n155\n00:17:21.623 --> 00:17:23.876\nAnd then, at that moment...\n\n156\n00:17:23.959 --> 00:17:24.835\nGetsuga!\n\n157\n00:17:25.419 --> 00:17:27.755\nIt's over now!\n\n158\n00:17:36.138 --> 00:17:37.056\nKurosaki.\n\n159\n00:17:43.187 --> 00:17:45.189\nYou are the final onlooker.\n\n160\n00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:49.318\nI'll make you watch yourself\nvanish from this world,\n\n161\n00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.694\nunable to protect anything,\n\n162\n00:17:50.778 --> 00:17:52.154\nleave nothing behind,\n\n163\n00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:53.739\nunable to do anything,\n\n164\n00:17:53.822 --> 00:17:55.324\nand end up being annihilated.\n\n165\n00:17:56.366 --> 00:18:00.829\nI will protect Kurosaki.\n\n166\n00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:04.291\nYour unwavering will is commendable,\n\n167\n00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:08.962\nbut with your power,\nlet alone protecting Ichigo,\n\n168\n00:18:09.046 --> 00:18:12.216\nyou are far from even qualified\nto fight alongside him.\n\n169\n00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:14.343\nThe reason you are here\n\n170\n00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:17.304\nis because Ichigo is too immature\nto let go of his naivety.\n\n171\n00:18:17.387 --> 00:18:18.764\nYhwach!\n\n172\n00:18:27.272 --> 00:18:31.151\nThat woman has always been your weakness.\n\n173\n00:18:31.777 --> 00:18:35.239\nWhat hinders you from fighting\n\n174\n00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:38.242\nis precisely the reason\nyou hold your sword,\n\n175\n00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:40.202\nwhich is your heartfelt desire to protect.\n\n176\n00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.415\nIt is because you fight\nthat you will be defeated.\n\n177\n00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:47.501\nIchigo.\n\n178\n00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:13.986\nBankai.\n\n179\n00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:21.201\nHakka no Togame.\n\n180\n00:19:27.749 --> 00:19:28.792\nGetsuga\n\n181\n00:19:28.876 --> 00:19:31.044\nTensho!\n\n182\n00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.663\nKuchiki.\n\n183\n00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:13.212\nThis is true power.\n\n184\n00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:16.673\nYou are too foolish,\n\n185\n00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:20.344\nIchigo.\n\n186\n00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:26.725\nThis is the outcome of the protective\npower you were talking about.\n\n187\n00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:33.482\nAnd this is the proof\nof the mighty power I spoke of.\n\n188\n00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.777\n<i>If only my power</i>\n\n189\n00:20:37.903 --> 00:20:43.742\n<i>could become stronger...</i>\n\n190\n00:20:49.957 --> 00:20:53.335\nBe reduced to ashes, Uryu Ishida.\n\n191\n00:20:56.505 --> 00:20:58.924\nJust as I expected, Uryu Ishida.\n\n192\n00:20:59.007 --> 00:21:00.300\nYour trump card,\n\n193\n00:21:01.468 --> 00:21:03.303\nthe Leiden Hant.\n\n194\n00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:06.473\nCome on, I've seen through\nyour next move too.\n\n195\n00:21:07.224 --> 00:21:10.269\nYou'd better not use\nHis Majesty Yhwach's power\n\n196\n00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:13.313\nwithout restraint.\n\n197\n00:21:14.189 --> 00:21:15.524\nIt'll leave you open.\n\n198\n00:21:15.607 --> 00:21:16.984\nOpen?\n\n199\n00:21:17.734 --> 00:21:22.322\nAre you saying that because\nyou've already gotten behind me?\n\n200\n00:21:26.368 --> 00:21:27.786\nShuno.\n\n201\n00:21:33.333 --> 00:21:34.584\nTsubaki.\n\n202\n00:21:37.087 --> 00:21:38.255\nAyame.\n\n203\n00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:40.382\nHinagiku.\n\n204\n00:21:43.927 --> 00:21:44.970\nBaigon.\n\n205\n00:21:45.595 --> 00:21:46.722\nLily.\n\n206\n00:22:05.282 --> 00:22:07.701\n<i>Why am I so weak?</i>\n\n207\n00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:13.582\n<i>Why is my power so small?</i>\n\n208\n00:22:18.837 --> 00:22:20.172\nSternstaup!\n\n209\n00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:22.341\nI see it.\n\n210\n00:22:26.344 --> 00:22:28.221\n- Darn it!\n- Three seconds.\n\n211\n00:22:28.305 --> 00:22:31.099\nIf I look like I'm running around,\n\n212\n00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:33.268\nthat's the reason for your defeat.\n\n213\n00:22:33.351 --> 00:22:35.520\nOnce you use the Almighty,\n\n214\n00:22:35.604 --> 00:22:37.689\nyou can't use that power again\nwithin three seconds.\n\n215\n00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:41.276\nA mere three seconds\ncould never give you a chance to win.\n\n216\n00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:45.906\nBut I still got three seconds.\n\n217\n00:22:53.371 --> 00:22:56.124\n<i>If my power</i>\n\n218\n00:22:57.292 --> 00:23:00.504\n<i>were stronger than it is now,</i>\n\n219\n00:23:02.631 --> 00:23:05.008\n<i>so strong that even I couldn't bear it,</i>\n\n220\n00:23:05.967 --> 00:23:08.220\n<i>so vast and boundless...</i>\n\n221\n00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.436\n<i>If it could just envelop the entire world,</i>\n\n222\n00:23:16.937 --> 00:23:23.819\n<i>it would eliminate fighting, injury, pain,</i>\n\n223\n00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:26.696\n<i>and everything.</i>\n\n224\n00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:43.839\n<i>So I...</i>\n\n225\n00:23:44.548 --> 00:23:48.593\nAre you sacrificing yourself,\nOrihime Inoue?\n\n226\n00:23:58.186 --> 00:23:59.354\nThis thing...\n\n227\n00:23:59.437 --> 00:24:03.150\nWith this thing,\nI can make your power disappear.\n\n228\n00:24:14.244 --> 00:24:15.245\nWait.\n\n229\n00:24:17.455 --> 00:24:18.415\nInoue!\n\n230\n00:24:18.999 --> 00:24:21.293\nInoue...\n\n231\n00:25:08.465 --> 00:25:10.508\nBLEACH EPISODE 45\n\n232\n00:25:10.592 --> 00:25:12.802\n<i>Bye-bye, Kurosaki.</i>\n\n233\n00:25:13.303 --> 00:25:16.431\n<i>I'll block it all for you.</i>\n\n234\n00:25:16.514 --> 00:25:17.766\nDEFEND YOU\n\n235\n00:25:17.849 --> 00:25:20.894\nLIFE TO DEFEND YOU\n\n";

